+
+**Still open, in evidence order**: i686 RA quality (the +505 slot stores —
+greedy start-point scan spends the 4-register pool on long-lived values;
+short-lived in-loop values lose), x87↔GP pair lowering (`i686.md` §2.1,
+untouched), the `free_large_kmalloc` discriminator, `reg-to-reg-movl` +230
+(but only 26 of 74 survive into the *object* — measure objects, not `-S`),
+`compare-against-frame-slot` +29.
